Gtk# 2.12 reference assemblies (LGPL).

These are the signed 2.12.0.0 assemblies (PublicKeyToken=35e10195dab3c99f)
plus Mono.Cairo and Mono.Posix (PublicKeyToken=0738eb9f132ed756).
dotnet MSBuild does not consult the Mono GAC, so they are HintPath'd
from GtkSharp.refs.targets for a full-solution compile.

They are compile-time references only. Running the GTK client still
needs a native GTK 2 / gtk-sharp 2.12 install.
